OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIsolated showers across eastern
OL,6,Fareas initially, then gradually mostly
OL,7,Fdying away this afternoon. Further
OL,8,Fwest remaining dry, with a sunny start
OL,9,Fthen patchy cloud and sunny intervals.
OL,10,FBreezy coastal conditions slowly ease.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMainly dry at first with long
OL,13,Fclear periods. Later in the night
OL,14,Fscattered showers arrive along the
OL,15,Fcoast, perhaps pushing showers a
OL,16,Flittle way inland. Becoming chilly,
OL,17,Fwith light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,165,160,301,260,100,100
